            "review_title": "Review at Tea Avenue",
            "review_text": "Tremor T. Pham\n8 contributions\n0\nCozy place to meet up with friends. Reasonable price!!!\nMar 2019 • Friends\nThis tea restaurant offers good dishes and tea mixology. We had tuna waffle, nachos, taco fusion and shaking beef (I don’t eat veggie so I request beef only for my dish). The food is fabulous. Flavor is fusion between Western and Asian. \nFor drinks, we have tried hot tea and cold fruit teas, the hot tea soursop is nice, but not suitable for weather in Ho Chi Minh. So I recommend you to try Asia Black Tea Fruit Tea and Day Dreaming are what we had. So refreshing.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 12, 2019",
